###Block: Descriptions
Aberrate.MOD	DESC:Subject becomes an aberration.
Abyssal Might.MOD	DESC:Caster gains +2 to STR, CON, DEX and SR,.
Addiction.MOD	DESC:Subject becomes addicted to a drug. Drug:the chosen drug for the addiction.
Alert Bebilith.MOD	DESC:Summons bebilith to deal with a demon.
Black Bag.MOD	DESC:Create extradimensional bag of torture tools.
Bodak Birth.MOD	DESC:Transforms a willing subject into a Bodak. Drug:Agony
Boneblade.MOD	DESC:Turns a bone into a magic weapon.
Boneblast.MOD	DESC:1d3 CON damage to subject.
Call Dretch Horde.MOD	DESC:Summon 2d4 dretches.
Call Lemure Horde.MOD	DESC:Summon 2d4 lemures.
Call Nightmare.MOD	DESC:Summon a Nightmare.
Charnel Fire.MOD	DESC:Consumes one corpse or undead creature.
Circle of Nausea.MOD	DESC:Foes are denied all actions or take -2 penalty on attacks, saving throws and skill check.
Claws of the Savage.MOD	DESC:Subject gains claws that deal damage based on size.
Cloud of the Achaierai.MOD	DESC:Cloud deals 2d6 damage plus Confusion. Disease: Soul Rot
Cruel Disappointment.MOD	DESC:Fools subject for 1 round, then -4 penalty on attacks, saves and checks.
Crushing Fist of Spite.MOD	DESC:Fist deals 1d6/damage/level each round. Disease: Festering anger
Curse of the Putrid Husk.MOD	DESC:Subject is unconscious for 1d10 minutes.
Dance of Ruin.MOD	DESC:Nondemons take 2d20 damage.
Dancing Chains.MOD	DESC:Animates one chain/level.
Darklight.MOD	DESC:Creates 5-ft radius area where all can see without light.
Death Grimace.MOD	DESC:Caster leaves magical "calling card" on a corpse.
Demon Wings.MOD	DESC:Caster flies at  his land speed.
Demoncall.MOD	DESC:Caster gains +10 on one Knowledge (The Planes), Knowledge (Arcana) or Knowledge (Religion) checks.
Demonflesh.MOD	DESC:Caster gains +1 natural armor/5 caster levels.
Devil's Tail.MOD	DESC:Caster fgains a spiked tail that deals 1d4 damage.
Distort Summon.MOD	DESC:Creates area where only evil creatures can be summoned.
Distort Weapon.MOD	DESC:Weapon confirms critical hits against good foes.
Dread Word.MOD	DESC:1d3 CON drain on one target.
Drown (BoVD).MOD	DESC:Subject begins to drown or takes 2d6 damage.
Drug Resistance.MOD	DESC:Subject is immune to addiction.
Ectoplasmic Enhancement.MOD	DESC:Incorporeal undead gain +1 AC, +1d8 hp, +1 on attacks and +2 turn resistance for every 3 levels.
Evil Eye.MOD	DESC:Subject takes -4 penalty on attacks, saves and checks.
Extract Drug.MOD	DESC:Creates drug from inanimate object.
Eye of the Beholder.MOD	DESC:Caster's eye gains random beholdxer ray.
Eye of the Zombie.MOD	DESC:Caster sees through a zombie's eyes'
False Sending.MOD	DESC:As Sending, except caster imitates someone else.
Fiendish Clarity.MOD	DESC:Caster sees in even magical darkness, see invisible up to 60-ft and can detect good.
Fiendish Quickening.MOD	DESC:Caster's ability to teleport without error is quickened.
Flesh Armor.MOD	DESC:Caster gains DR 10/+1 (10/magic)
Glimpse of Truth.MOD	DESC:Caster gets an answer to a yes-or-no question. Drug: Mordayn Vapor
Graz'zt's Long Grasp.MOD	DESC:Caster's hand flies from her arm to make grapple attacks.
Grim Revenge.MOD	DESC:Tears hand from target, dealing 6d6 damage, then hand attacks target.
Gutwrench.MOD	DESC:Kills subject and gives caster 4d6 temporary hit points and +4 STR.
Heartache.MOD	DESC:Subject helpless for 1 round.
Heartclutch.MOD	DESC:Subject dies in 1d3 rounds or take 3d6 damage ++1/level. Disease: Soul Rot
Hell's Power.MOD	DESC:Caster gains +2 AC and +1 to existing DR.
Identify Transgressor.MOD	DESC:Caster learns the identity of one person. Drug: Vodare. Location: an area under the effect of a Desecrate or Unhallow spell.
Impotent Possessor.MOD	DESC:Subject that can possess creatures is rendered powerless.
Imprison Possessor.MOD	DESC:Subject that can possess creatures is trapped in current body.
Masochism.MOD	DESC:For every 10 hp damage caster takes, he gains +1 on attacks, saves and checks.
Mindrape.MOD	DESC:Caster learns everything subject knows and can alter its memory or knowledge.
Mirror Sending.MOD	DESC:Caster sends her image to a mirror and can see and speak through it.
Nether Trail.MOD	DESC:Creates a trail compelling evil orders to follow
No Light.MOD	DESC:Prevents normal light from illuminating.
Preserve Organ.MOD	DESC:Protects one detached organ from decay for 24 hours.
Psychic Poison.MOD	DESC:Poisons those casting Divination or Mind-Affecting spells at object, creature or area.
Reality Blind.MOD	DESC:Subject can take no actions and afterward does not heal naturally.
Resonating Resistance.MOD	DESC:Foes must check spell resistance twice against caster.
Sacrificial Skill.MOD	DESC:Caster gains +5 bonus on Knowledge (Religion) checks made during sacrifice.
Sap Strength.MOD	DESC:Subject becomes exhausted.
Shriveling.MOD	DESC:Subject takes 1d4 damage/level. Disease: Soul Rot
Slash Tongue.MOD	DESC:Subject takes -1 penalty on attacks, saves and check for 1 round.
Slow Consumption.MOD	DESC:Caster absorb health and sustenance from helpless subject.Location: an area under the effect of a Desecrate or Unhallow spell.
Snare Astral Traveler.MOD	DESC:Capture one astral creature and holds it motionless.
Song of Festering Death.MOD	DESC:Subject takes 2d6 damage per round while caster concentrate.
Sorrow.MOD	DESC:Subject takes -3 penalty on attacks, saves and checks.
Soul's Shackles.MOD	DESC:Imprisons soul of dead creature in talisman, from wich the caster can question it. Location: an area under the effect of a Desecrate or Unhallow spell.
Soul's Treasure Lost.MOD	DESC:Disintegrates subject's most valuable object.
Spider Hand.MOD	DESC:Caster's hand becomes a small monstrous spider.
Spider Legs.MOD	DESC:Caster grows long spider legs that have a speed of 30-ft and move on vertical surfaces.
Spread of Savagery.MOD	DESC:Creatures within 10-ft/level become hostile and savage.
Steal Life.MOD	DESC:Caster drains 1 ability score point/round and becomes younger. Location: an area under the effect of a Desecrate or Unhallow spell.
Stop Heart.MOD	DESC:Subject drops to -8 hp immediately. Drug: Baccaran
Stunning Screech.MOD	DESC:All within 30-ft are stunned for 1 round. Drug: Mushroom powder
Stupor.MOD	DESC:One helpless subject is put in a state that allows him to be moved but take no other action.
Suspend Disease.MOD	DESC:Keeps disease from harming creature for 24 hours.
Tongue of Baalzebul.MOD	DESC:Caster gains +2 bonus on Bluff , Diplomacy and Gather Information. Drug: Mushroom powder
Tongue Serpents.MOD	DESC:Caster spits ount one Tiny viper/4 levels.
Tongue Tendrils.MOD	DESC:Caster spits out tendrils that grapple.
Unheavened.MOD	DESC:Subject gains +4 save bonus against power of good outsiders. Drug: Vodare.
Unliving Weapon.MOD	DESC:Undead subject explodes for 1d6 damage/2 levels when struck or at specific time.
Unnerving Gaze.MOD	DESC:Subject takes -1 penalty on attacks for 1d3 rounds.
Vile Lance.MOD	DESC:Creates +2 shortspear that deals vile damage.
Wall of Chains.MOD	DESC:Creates barrier of woven chains that has 20 hp/4 caster levels.
Wall of Deadly Chains.MOD	DESC:Creates barrier of woven chains that has 20 hp/4 caster levels and deals 3d6 damage to all within 5-ft.
Wall of Eyes.MOD	DESC:Creates barrier that caster can see through and that paralyzes and consumes those that touch it.
Wall of Ooze.MOD	DESC:Creates barrier that has 50 hp/4 levels that paralyzes and deals 2d6 damage to all that touch it.
Were-Doom.MOD	DESC:1d4 creatures are infected with Lycanthropy.
Spores of the Vrock.MOD	DESC:All within 5-ft take 1d8 damage and 1d2 damage each round thereafter for 10 round.
Wither Limb (BoVD).MOD	DESC:Caster reduces subject's speed to 5-ft or make it impossible for subject to use objects or cast somatic spells.
Wretched Blight.MOD	DESC:Deals 1d8 damage/level, in 20-ft radius and stuns foes for 1d4 rounds.
Whirlwind of Teeth.MOD	DESC:Creates moving 5-ft/level cylinder that deals 1d8 damage/2 levels each round.
Absorb Mind.MOD	DESC:Caster gains 25%% chance of knowing information in a brain eaten. Corrupt:2d6 WIS damage.
Absorb Strength.MOD	DESC:Caster gains 1/4 of creature's STR and CON when he eats it. Corrupt:2d6 WIS damage.
Apocalypse from the Sky.MOD	DESC:All in a 10-mile radius/level take 10d6 damage. Corrupt:3d6 CON damage, 4d6 WIS drain. Preparing the spell deals 1d3 WIS damage + 1d3 WIS damage/day.
Befoul (Vile).MOD	DESC:Large amount of water becomes poisonous.
Claws of the Bebilith.MOD	DESC:Caster gains cLawfuls based on her size. Corrupt:1d6 DEX damage.
Consume Likeness.MOD	DESC:Caster steals the appearance of a dead person, adding +10 on Disguise checks. Corrupt:2d6 WIS drain.
Death by Thorns.MOD	DESC:Up to three creatures die in 1d4 rounds or are incapacitated, taking 4d6 damage. Corrupt:1d6 WIS drain.
Devil's Tongue.MOD	DESC:Tongue grapples with reach 15-ft. Corrupt:1d6 WIS damage.
Evil Weather.MOD	DESC:Caster conjures one type of evil weather. Corrupt:3d6 CON damage.
Fangs of the Vampire King (Corrupt).MOD	DESC:Caster gains bite attack with +10 bonus that deals 1d6 damage and 1 CON damage. Corrupt:1d6 STR damage.
Forbidden Speech.MOD	DESC:Subject cannot speek about a certain topic. Corrupt:1d6 STR damage.
Lahm's Finger Darts.MOD	DESC:Caster's fingers become projectiles that deal 1d4 DEX damage. Corrupt:1 STR damage/dart
Love's Pain.MOD	DESC:Deals 1d6 damage/2 levels to subject's dearest loved one. Corrupt:1d6 INT damage
Plague of Nightmares.MOD	DESC:Subject takes 1d4 CON damage and does not heal. Corrupt:1d6 STR damage.
Power Leech (BoVD).MOD	DESC:Caster drains subject's ability score 1 point/round and gains +1 bonus per point. Corrupt:1 WIS drain.
Rapture of Rupture.MOD	DESC:Subject takes 6d6 damage and is stunned, then takes 1d6 damage/round thereafter. Corrupt:1 STR damage/target.
Red Fester.MOD	DESC:Subject takes 1d6 STR damage and 1d4 CHA damage. Corrupt:1d6 STR damage.
Rotting Curse of Urfestra.MOD	DESC:Subject takes 1d6 CON damage per hour. Corrupt:1d6 STR damage.
Seething Eyebane.MOD	DESC:Subject is blinded and all within 5-ft take 1d6 damage. Corrupt:1d6 CON damage.
Serpent of Theggeron.MOD	DESC:Caster's arms become serpents with 10-ft reach, +10 attack and 1d8 damage plus poison. Corrupt:1d6 INT damage.
Touch of Juiblex.MOD	DESC:Subject turns to green slime in 4 rounds. Corrupt:1d6 STR damage.

